{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"common":false,"etymology":["借自英語 Scotland。"],"examples":[{"en":"He is Scottish by origin.","ja":"彼は生まれはスコットランドです。","ref":"300465_103228","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The picture reminded me of Scotland.","ja":"私はその写真でスコットランドを思い出した。","ref":"254453_160069","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"My plan is visiting old castles in Scotland.","ja":"私の計画はスコットランドの古城を訪れることです。","ref":"250748_163763","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"What's Scotland like in summer?","ja":"夏のスコットランドはどんなふうですか。","ref":"24368_187231","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Mr Thompson had lived in Tokyo for two years before he went back to Scotland.","ja":"トンプソンさんは２年間東京に住んでからスコットランドに帰った。","ref":"36565_199363","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["蘇格蘭"],"glosses":["Scotland"],"id":"1069140","lemma":"蘇格蘭","pos":["n"],"readings":["スコットランド"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/スコットランド#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/ス/スコ/スコットランド.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["蘇格蘭","スコットランドredirected from 蘇格蘭"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["蘇格蘭"],"pos":"name"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["スコットランドredirected from 蘇格蘭"],"pos":"non-lemma"}]},{"accent":2,"common":true,"etymology":["源自俄語 сове́т (sovét)。"],"examples":[{"en":"He defected to the Soviet Union in the 1950's.","ja":"彼は１９５０年代にソビエト連邦へ逃亡した。","ref":"288396_115275","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I don't know about the USSR at all.","ja":"私はソビエト連邦のことはまったく知らない。","ref":"254741_159781","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The Cold War ended when the Soviet Union collapsed.","ja":"冷戦はソビエトの崩壊と共に終わった。","ref":"326069_77649","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["蘇維埃"],"glosses":["soviet","Soviet Union"],"id":"1075470","lemma":"蘇維埃","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ソビエト","readings":["ソビエト","ソヴィエト"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/ソビエト#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/ソ/ソビ/ソビエト.html"],"synonyms":["ソヴェト"],"zhGlosses":["蘇維埃"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["蘇維埃"],"pos":"n"}]},{"ac